From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 01:05:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rt(engine,tfe): use the runtime RT tuning table in the TFE
 tree too

Same CustomInfo/CustomInfoTuning code as the TSE tree (the RT layer
files stay identical between SamTFE and SamTSE). The TFE values are
migrated mechanically from Serious-Engine-RT's CustomInfo.cpp tables
into SamTFE/SSTRE/RT/WorldTuning.txt: 15 worlds, 224 keys, 68 texture
paths in 17 classes. A count check of the migrated lists against the
original source matches for every list (ignored polygons 75, ignored
sectors 4, ignored ranges 10, masked polygons 10, masked sectors 8,
masked ranges 7, cutscene lights 23).

Ported code: Serious-Engine-RT (https://github.com/sultim-t/Serious-Engine-RT,
GPL-2.0-only) by Sultim Tsyrendashiev; original copyright notices kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
